+# Prioritized Operator Runbook — Aegis Production Cutover (High-level, prioritized)
+
+This runbook organizes the remaining high‑impact tasks into prioritized milestones with owners, time estimates, and success criteria so your team can run to production certification.
+
+Legend
+- Owner: recommended role (Platform/SRE, Crypto, ML Eng, Safety, Legal, Finance)
+- ETA: estimated effort (days) assuming an experienced team and access to cloud/hardware
+- Risk: high/med/low
+- Success criteria: measurable signoff criteria
+
+PRIORITY 0 — Safety & Emergency controls (blockers for production)
+1) Kill‑switch & M‑of‑N enforcement integration (Immediate)
+   - Owner: Crypto / Platform
+   - ETA: 1 day
+   - Tasks:
+     - Ensure Vault flag path secret/data/aegis/flags is writable by operators
+     - Integrate delegation_enforcer.py into orchestrator pre‑exec hook for high‑risk actions
+     - Smoke test kill_switch.sh disable/enable
+   - Success: Orchestrator refuses to execute sensitive actions when kill‑switch disabled (automated test)
